<% content_for :title, page_title("Privacy Policy") %>

<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<div class="pagetext">

  <p>
    Names, email addresses, phone numbers and zip codes are collected when you sign up for the mailing list or RSVP to a show.
  </p>

  <p>
    Email addresses you submit are only used to send concert invitations.
  </p>

  <p>
    <% if SendTextMessage.enabled? %>
      Phone numbers you submit are only used to send text message reminders for that specific show.
    <% else %>
      Phone numbers you submit are only used to contact you about that specific show.
    <% end %>
  </p>

  <p>
    Your information is not shared with any third parties.
  </p>

  <p>
    For questions, email privacy at houseconcerts dot nyc.
  </p>

</div>
